Scalability & Future Plan
1. Additional Branches

The system can be extended to support additional branches and branch-specific access requirements.

2. Additional Roles

Additional roles can be introduced for different departments and responsibilities.

3. Additional Tables

The access-control approach can be applied to other ServiceNow tables.

4. Advanced Conditions

More advanced field-based conditions can be introduced for complex access requirements.

5. Automated Testing

Automated testing can be introduced to validate ACL behavior more efficiently.

6. Future Integration

The solution can be integrated with other ServiceNow applications and enterprise workflows.

7. Long-Term Scope

The project can be expanded into a broader access-management framework for securing multiple types of institutional information.
